# Auth & RBAC

## Authentication

Use **Nest-owned HttpOnly session cookies** only (`chhata_session` in Postgres `Session`). Do not invent a second auth/session system.

```text
POST /api/v1/auth/login → Session row + cookie → AuthGuard → RBAC
```

Portal is a same-origin BFF (`/api/*` → Nest). Never expose `SESSION_SECRET` to the browser or `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.

## Authorization

Permission-based: `resource:action` (e.g. `survey:read`, `payment:refund`, `role:update`).

Avoid `if (role === "ADMIN")` except rare system exceptions. Prefer `hasPermission(user, "survey:update")`.

### Backend (security)

Every protected endpoint enforces permissions server-side (AuthGuard / PermissionGuard / `@RequirePermission`). Unauthorized → **403**. Frontend checks are not security.

### Frontend (UX only)

Reuse `usePermission` / `hasPermission` / `can` to hide unauthorized nav/actions. Same permission must be enforced on the API.
